      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Set this field to `true` if the customer provided consent to send the App Store the consumption data related to their refund request, including all the data you provide in the `ConsumptionRequest` or `ConsumptionRequestV1` request body. If not, don’t respond to the `CONSUMPTION_REQUEST` notification.",
